# Local RE artifacts (`tmp/`)

For **Mazda CMU OEM** or **VietMap Live / `vietmap_hud_sdk`** reverse engineering, use the gitignored trees under **`oem-aa-mod/tmp/`** (not macOS `/tmp` unless symlinked):

- `tmp/mazda_cmu_fw/` — CMU150 **`74.00.324A`**: `bins/blmjcicarplay.so`, `rootfs_probe/`, `rootfs1.tar`, update zips.
- `tmp/vietmap_ipa_extract/` — `Payload/Runner.app/Frameworks/vietmap_hud_sdk.framework/vietmap_hud_sdk` (arm64).

Full layout, commands, and mirrors: [knowledge/agent-tmp-artifacts.md](../../knowledge/agent-tmp-artifacts.md).

Rules: verify paths exist before RE; prefer small extracts over unpacking multi-GB archives; never commit `tmp/`; document findings in English under `knowledge/`.